// settings.dict (generated CRUD; see docs/design-notes.md#codegen, #api-envelope): list filters/sort/paging, get, create, update, delete,
// batch delete, enabled toggle, export;
// 403 per permission, 400 translated, 409 duplicate, 404 unknown ids, @Idempotent, @ActionLog rows,
// Swagger. Hand-written (G module): dotted codes set once, per-locale names, the options lookup, a
// dict with entries kept (409), and the read cache (GET /dicts/:code/entries) following every write of
// dicts and entries, plus the refresh-cache action.
